# Folders the launcher creates next to itself when it runs (see Launcher/README.md).
/Game/
/Game_previous/
/UserData/
/Downloads/
/Backups/
/_staging/
/_modstaging/
/_swap/
/Launcher/settings.json
/Launcher/*.bak

# The starter exe is built from src/ and committed on purpose (the repo ignores *.exe elsewhere).
!/CDDA Fork Launcher.exe
